- brotli (C/brotli/) - "Copyright (c) 2009, 2010, 2013-2016 by the Brotli
  Authors." (MIT)
- lz4 (C/lz4/) - "Copyright (c) 2011-2020, Yann Collet" (BSD 2-Clause)
- lz5 (C/lz5/) - "Copyright (c) 2011-2015, Yann Collet" (BSD 2-Clause; the
